  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Yei Emergency preparedness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of this project is to develop the capacity of Caritas Yei (the development wing of catholic diocese of Yei) to provide humanitarian response assistance to affected people by engaging on preparedness activities . The project is also thought to revitalize the functionalization of Caritas Yei that has been redundant for the last two years as a capacity enhancement measure in order to be able to respond to the anticipated emergency situations in the country, including any scenarios that develop during the build up to the referendum and the aftermath of the Referenda and any other natural or man made disasters.  
The overall Objective is; To strengthen the capacity of caritas Yei in preparedness to respond to humanitarian crisis that might affect the diocese. This intervention will focus on trainings, staffing, and provision of communication equipment and preparation of storage &amp; office facilities. 
The expected results are; Caritas Yei be able to recruit 3 radio operators, 1 Administration and finance officer , Renovate 2 stores in diocesan headquarter in Yei, renovate 1 office space in Mundri, transfer  &amp; erect 1 rub hall in Mundri, install 3 HF radio in 3 selected parishes , 2 thuraya handset acquired, complete policy guideline for diocesan resource management and HR policy, conduct 1 training each on radio communication and  first aid/ trauma management and repair 1 diocesan truck by the end of the project period.
The direct beneficiaries of the project will be the 4 staff (3 radio operator &amp; 1 finance admin officer) to be recruited and those that will participate in the training and renovation work.</narrative>
  </description>
